g":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Bug Description\n\nWhen I try to start my fiber application, which has a CORS origin configured with a protocol other than `http` or `https`, the application panics. \r\n\r\nSpecifically, [KaiOS devices](https://kaios.dev/2023/04/security-and-privacy-on-kaios/) need to have a CORS origin configured with the protocol: `app://` \r\n\r\n--------\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/c86c3c0a30a87eba3ada305fc70162ea8c875a54/middleware/cors/cors.go#L49-L52\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/c86c3c0a30a87eba3ada305fc70162ea8c875a54/middleware/cors/utils.go#L34-L43\n\n### How to Reproduce\n\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Configure the origin `app://example.com` in the CORS middleware\r\n2. Start fiber\r\n3. -> App panics\r\n\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nDo not panic, but allow origins with any protocol.\n\n### Fiber Version\n\nv2.52.5\n\n### Code Snippet (optional)\n\n```go\npackage main\r\n\r\nimport (\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2\"\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2/middleware/cors\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nfunc main() {\r\n\tapp := fiber.New()\r\n\r\n\tapp.Use(cors.New(cors.Config{\r\n\t\tAllowOrigins: \"https://example.com, app://example.com\",\r\n\t}))\r\n\r\n\tapp.Get(\"/\", func(c *fiber.Ctx) error {\r\n\t\treturn c.SendString(\"Hello, World!\")\r\n\t})\r\n\r\n\tapp.Listen(\":3000\")\r\n}\n```\n\n\n### Checklist:\n\n- [X] I agree to follow Fiber's [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/master/.github/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n- [X] I have checked for existing issues that describe my problem prior to opening this one.\n- [X] I understand that improperly formatted bug reports may be closed without explanation.","closed_by":{"login":"efectn","id":45270788,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjcwNzg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45270788?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn","html_url":"https://github.com/efectn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efectn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/3160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/3160/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}